      "value": "The issue is affecting Android app, and maybe also the iOS app. The issue specifically began after when build 1919 was released on the smartphone platforms.\n\nIt is specifically the textbox that is attached to the native smartphone keyboard. The text is white and the input field itself has a white background. \n\nOnly way to see the actual text is to highlight it or look at the in-game input field.",
